00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:36.480
So sit back, hit that sub button and get ready for the Top 10 rifle and pistol flicks in CS:GO.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:45.720
Kicking off our list is KennyS on Cobblestone. Who in a 1v3 landed this disgusting deagle flick onto MSL

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:49.940
