00:00:49.940 --> 00:01:02.200
(Casting)

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:08.100
From one prodigy to another, our number nine play sees Coldzera terrorize Tyloo.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.500
Pinned between four players, Cold more than holds his own as he takes down DD,

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.640
