00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:40.720
No seriously, we needed to slow this down just
to see it.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:59.660
(Casting)

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:05.340
At number seven we’ve got GeT_RiGhT with an unbelievable kill to open up the round.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:11.920
Up 13-9 against SK gaming, the NiP legend landed an unbelievable upwards flick

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:15.520
